    "Tansu could not move %@. Try again, or move it with Command-drag.": {},
    "Tansu could not open %@.": {},
    "Tansu does not see any icon to sort yet. Your drawers will fill as apps add theirs.": {},
    "Tansu found %lld icons. Here is a tidier menu bar.": {},
    "Tansu is not affiliated with Apple.": {},
    "Tansu needs Accessibility to open icons.": {},
    "Tansu needs Accessibility to see and arrange your icons.": {},
    "Tansu needs Accessibility to see which app owns each icon and to open them for you. It never records your screen and never goes online, except to check for updates.": {},
    "Tansu only reads whether a camera or a microphone runs; it never records anything and needs no permission.": {},
    "Tansu sees no icon to show yet.": {},
    "Tansu sorts the icons of your menu bar into drawers, each one a single icon. The menu bar keeps what you look at all day; everything else waits in a drawer, one click away.": {},
    "Tansu works best from Applications: it can open at login and update itself there, and macOS 27 lets only apps there change the menu bar.": {},
    "Tansu's icon, then your drawers in the order set in Drawers. Turn it off to place them yourself with a Command-drag.": {},
